	(text "CON-2 GPS / external mag, 7 pads: J20 GND, J21 5V, J22 TX4, J23 RX4,\nJ24 SCL, J25 SDA, J26 3V3 - keep 5V and 3V3 apart when placing"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 103.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e5000000-1000-4000-8000-000000000038")
	)
	(text "CON-3 spare UART (USART3, RC receiver), 4 pads:\nJ30 GND, J31 5V, J32 RX3, J33 TX3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 136.53 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e5000000-1000-4000-8000-000000000039")
	)
	(text "ESC-3 ESC harness, 9 pads: J40 GND, J41 VIN (+10V), J42 VBAT,\nJ43-J46 M1-M4, J47 CURR, J48 TLM. Individual pads, so there is no\npad ORDER left to confuse with the J7 connector numbering."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 160.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e5000000-1000-4000-8000-00000000003a")
	)
	(text "IND-3 addressable LED strip, 3 pads: J50 GND, J51 LED5V, J52 LED\nLED5V is +5V_BUCK, the buck output AHEAD of the U8 power mux, so strip\ncurrent never crosses the mux and the strip stays dark on USB alone.\nR21 damps the data edge into the wire; there is no level shifter, and\ndriving a WS2812 from 3.3 V is marginal per its datasheet even if every\nFC does it."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 230 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e5000000-1000-4000-8000-00000000003b")
	)
	(text "External IO - individual through-hole solder pads, plus the J7 ESC connector"
