			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Notes" "ESC connector wired in parallel with the J6 pad row. JST-SH 1.00 mm 10-pin side-entry receptacle (SM..B; the BM..B variants are top entry, do not substitute) that mates with the plug already fitted to the T-Motor Velox 45A V2 harness, so that harness plugs straight in, stays removable and needs no soldering. PIN ORDER IS THE MEASURED VELOX WIRE ORDER AND IS NOT THE J6 PAD ORDER: 1 GND, 2 GND, 3 VBAT, 4 +10V, 5 M4, 6 M3, 7 M2, 8 M1, 9 CURR, 10 TLM - same nets as J6, different numbering, motor order reversed. Kept out of the BOM on purpose: the connector is expected to end up on the bottom side and SRC-1 has JLCPCB assemble the top side only, so it would be hand-soldered. LCSC C160409 is recorded here so the decision can be revisited at placement time, when the side is actually chosen."
			(at 190.5 185.42 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
