		(property "Notes" "CON-2 GPS / external magnetometer solder pad (reference module Matek M9N-5883, which needs 4-6 V on its own LDO, hence a 5V pad and not 3V3 only). Individual pad, no fixed geometry; silkscreen label is its VALUE field. Keep the 5V and 3V3 pads apart when placing: a bridge between them would put 5 V on the 3V3 rail. I2C1 pull-ups live on the Sensors sheet."
