		(property "Notes" "IND-3 addressable LED strip solder pad. Individual pad, no fixed geometry; silkscreen label is its VALUE field. The LED5V pad hangs on +5V_BUCK, the buck output taken AHEAD of the U8 power mux, so strip current never crosses the mux and the strip cannot light up on USB power alone. LED data comes from TIM1_CH3 (PA10) through R21."
			(at 76.2 208.28 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
